# Optional overrides — service availability is not guaranteed without them.

# YouTube
# Datacenter IPs (Vercel, AWS, …) sometimes get HTTP 403 from YouTube when a
# proof-of-origin (PO) token is missing. If downloads start failing with 403,
# supply one of these:
# YT_PO_TOKEN=<po token tied to the video/session>
# YT_VISITOR_DATA=<visitor data string>
# YT_COOKIE=<full cookie header from a logged-in browser>

# Instagram
# Reels/stories are more reliable with a logged-in session id. Never commit a
# real value; set it in your hosting dashboard.
# IG_SESSION_ID=<instagram sessionid cookie value>
